(BUGS_FOUND #96 - the guard fires only when a clause is genuinely still
 open at the `To`; a blank line force-closes the `For each` first (the
 termination rule's rule 2), so the definition that follows is read at the
 top level and this still compiles and runs, once.)

For each n from 1 to 3,
    If n is 99 then, Break.

To examine with a value called v.
    Print "{v's type}".

examine of "".
Exit 0.
